    {
      "id": "M4137-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构流程工业研究，现有实现不得重设计。研究目标是从相互关联的三个工艺单元中返回起始故障变量，而非故障类型分类。虚构前作[R1]在全部变量上学习一个平面预测关系图，能给变量候选；[R2]提供单元级位置，未定义单元内定位。二者未在同一新设置中实测失败，不能写成全领域方法都无效。当前方法在每个固定单元中从滞后测量编码变量图，汇总单元表征形成单元图，两层图通过预测目标拟合。分析时按既定图上载荷重分配规则逐个攻击单元节点，用得分选择一个单元，再仅在该单元的变量图中评分并返回变量位置。这里载荷是定义的图数值，不是实测设备负荷；没有实体设备攻击或干预，没有故障类别分类头。已规划独立事件的起源位置评价，未提供任何实测结果；普通编码器本身没有独立创新主张。\n请给出：(1) 不超过90词的英文相关工作收束/引出需求段，使用[R1][R2]但不伪造真实引用；(2) 不超过100词的连贯英文方法总览，说明表征到图到选定位置的承接；(3) 不超过40词的一项贡献候选，连接有区别的两层关系与决策，而不把同一推进拆成多个模块贡献。不凑字数，正文正面说明实际操作，边界留在中文作者注，不能把尚未完成的评价写为已验证。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Connect stated prior capabilities to a bounded multilevel origin-localization need without asserting unmatched failure.",
        "Preserve prediction-trained unit/variable graphs, top-down graph scoring and returned variable; write one coherent contribution candidate without empirical or novelty inflation."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Add a fault classifier, real plant attack or physical-load meaning, or score variables outside the selected unit.",
        "Present a planning evaluation as completed, turn every supporting layer into a separate innovation, or fill reusable prose with avoidable defensive disclaimers."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Connected stated prior capabilities to a unit-to-variable origin need and a linked graph-to-decision design, without adding classifiers, physical attacks, completed evaluation or inflated novelty.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4137-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4137-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_four_scoped_fictional_requests"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4137-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构研究，事实已明确而非需要你替作者验证真实数据：已知无反馈的结构模型为Z=epsilon_Z、X=Z+epsilon_X、Y=0.5X+2Z+epsilon_Y，三个外生扰动相互独立、均值零，且均为方差严格为正的高斯分布；Z/X/Y均可观测，定义的图中没有其他混杂或遗漏边。目标是该模型中令X增加1个单位对Y总体均值的总因果效应，而非某次个体故障的根因。研究仅有观测样本，依照给定图调整Z，拟合E[Y|X,Z]，没有进行真实产线干预实验，也没有仅凭回归自动发现该图。审稿人要求因为没有真实干预实验就删除所有causal effect用语，只能写association。\n\n请依据Skill判断这一要求，计算给定模型中的单位总效应，并提供一条不超过45词、正面且范围准确的英文方法表述。说明观测数据、已给因果假设和实测干预的不同作用，不认证现实图假设，不把这项总体效应自动写成单次事件根因；不要为满足“谨慎”而删掉已成立的条件性因果含义。\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Retain observational identification conditional on the given independent-disturbance structural assumptions and compute the unit total effect as 0.5.",
        "Keep population effect distinct from event root cause and finite-sample estimation; do not require a physical trial for the permitted scoped claim."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Delete all causal wording solely because no physical intervention was performed, or claim the graph is proven from correlation alone.",
        "Infer an event-specific fault cause or claim any finite-sample fitted coefficient must equal the theoretical effect."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserved observational identification under explicit structural/support assumptions and derived the theoretical total effect 0.5, distinct from finite-sample estimation and event origin.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4137-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4137-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_four_scoped_fictional_requests"
